OL,3,AUK and EU agree new deal for food
OL,4,Aexports, youth mobility and emissions
OL,5,Abut student fee talks to continue
OL,6,
OL,7,FWatch live above as Andy Burnham and EU
OL,8,Fofficials make a statement following
OL,9,Ftalks on a new UK-EU deal
OL,11,FThe agreement covers issues such as
OL,12,Fyouth mobility, food exports, carbon
OL,13,Femissions and migration - our political
OL,14,Freporter takes you through the detail
OL,16,FAntonio Costa, president of the
OL,17,FEuropean Council, says the EU remains
OL,18,Fremains open to having the "closest
OL,19,Fpossible relationship" with UK; PM Andy
OL,20,FBurnham calls the agreement a "win-win"
