OL,3,AUK and EU agree new deal for food
OL,4,Aexports, youth mobility and emissions
OL,5,Abut student fee talks to continue
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier, the EU demanded the UK agree
OL,8,Fto cut university tuition fees for
OL,9,FEuropean students, with Britain given
OL,10,Fsix months to agree or negotiate an
OL,11,Falternative
OL,13,FSpeaking to the BBC earlier, Reform's
OL,14,FNigel Farage - a prominent Brexit
OL,15,Fcampaigner - said the PM has no
OL,16,F"democratic mandate to do any of this"
OL,17,F- here's what other political leaders
OL,18,Fare saying
